Date: Wed, 24 Jun 2026 01:23:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD vim visual copy for terminal panes so focused text
 can be selected

Command-mode visual selections support character, line, and block ranges in the focused terminal pane. Copies are emitted through OSC52, and right-pane copy reads from the same scroll-adjusted content that is visibly highlighted.
---
