   reveal earlier transcript rows.
+- Visual mode is a terminal-only selection layer over the rendered pane buffers. In command mode,
+  `v`, `V`, and `Ctrl-V` start character, line, and block selections in the focused pane; `h`, `j`,
+  `k`, `l`, and arrow keys move the selection cursor; `y` and `Y` copy the selected visible text
